## Sync Workflow {#sync-workflow}

### Source of Truth Discipline

```
tasks.md + spec.md = SOURCE OF TRUTH
↓
Living docs (.specweave/docs/internal/specs/) = Derived
↓
External tools (GitHub/Jira/ADO) = Mirror
```

**Update Order**: Always update tasks.md FIRST, then sync outward.

### When to Sync

| Event | Action |
|-------|--------|
| Task completed | Update tasks.md `[ ]` → `[x]`, run sync commands |
| AC satisfied | Update spec.md checkbox |
| Increment done | `/specweave:done` → auto-syncs everything |
| Before PR | Verify all syncs complete |

### Claude Code Hooks (Automatic)

These hooks run automatically in Claude Code:
- `UserPromptSubmit`: Discipline checks, WIP limits
- `PostToolUse`: Task completion sync to GitHub

**Non-Claude tools**: No hooks exist. You must run sync commands manually.

