## Task Format

```markdown
### T-001: Task Title
**User Story**: US-001
**Satisfies ACs**: AC-US1-01, AC-US1-02
**Status**: [ ] pending / [x] completed

**Test Plan** (BDD):
- Given [context] → When [action] → Then [result]
